#: basics/node_communication.md
msgid ""
"Groups are another way to decouple, especially when you have a lot of "
"similar objects that need to do the same thing. A node can be added to any "
"number of groups and membership can be changed dynamically at any time with "
"`add_to_group()` and `remove_from_group()`."
msgstr ""
"グループ化はモジュール分離のもう一つの有効な手段であり、特に類似した複数のオ"
"ブジェクトで同じ処理が必要な場合に有効です。ノードはどのグループにも自由に追"
"加でき、メンバーシップは「`add_to_group()`」および「`remove_from_group()`」で"
"動的に変更可能です。"

