"Displaying the bar can be done with a {{< gd-icon TextureProgressBar >}}"
"`TextureProgress` node. This is like the {{< gd-icon ProgressBar >}}"
"`ProgressBar` node, but allows the use of textures for the bar itself. The "
"length of the bar will indicate the health value, but we can also change the "
"texture color. We'll use three colored bars for this:"
msgstr ""

#: ui/unit_healthbar.md
msgid ""
"When you attach this to a unit, the bar may appear too big. Set the _Scale_ "
"property of the instanced `HealthDisplay` to adjust based on the size of "
"your unit."
msgstr ""

#: ui/unit_healthbar.md
msgid ""
"Drag the green bar into the _Textures/Progress_ property and set its _Value_ "
"to `100`. Drag the bar until it's centered and above the origin."
msgstr ""

#: ui/unit_healthbar.md
