#: ui/debug_overlay.md
msgid ""
"In the `update_label()` method we build up a string to display in the "
"label's `text` property. We include the object's name and which property "
"we're showing, plus the value modified by the `mode` option."
msgstr ""
"def update_label(self):\n"
"    # ラベルの text プロパティに表示する文字列を構築\n"
"    label_content = f\"{self.object}: {self.property_name} ({self.value})\"\n"
"    if self.mode == 'edit':\n"
"        label_content += \" (編集モード)\"\n"
"    elif self.mode == 'view':\n"
"        label_content += \" (閲覧モード)\"\n"
"\n"
"    # 構築したコンテンツをラベルの text プロパティに設定\n"
"    self.widget.text = label_content\n"
"```"

#: ui/debug_overlay.md
msgid ""
"* `object` - This is a reference to the object we're tracking.\n"
"* `property` - This is in the form of a `NodePath`, meaning we can track "
"something like `\"position\"`, but also `\"position:x\"`.\n"
"* `label_ref` - Each property is linked to a {{< gd-icon Label >}}`Label` "
"node, this is a reference to the label so that we can set its `text`.\n"
"* `mode` - This is an optional setting to configure how the value should be "
"displayed (see below)."
msgstr ""
"・ `object` - 追跡対象オブジェクトへの参照です。\n"
"　・ `property` - `NodePath`形式で指定し、例えば `\"position\"` だけでなく "
"`\"position:x\"` のようなプロパティも追跡可能です。\n"
"　・ `label_ref` - 各プロパティは対応する {{< gd-icon Label >}}`Label`ノード"
"と紐付けられており、この参照によりラベルの `text`属性を設定できます。\n"
"　・ `mode` - 表示方法を指定するオプション設定です（詳細は後述）。"

