"For many developers, building a UI is their least favorite part. It's very "
"easy for a complex UI to spiral out of control and become impossibly painful "
"to fix or modify. Godot provides some great tools for building UI - and if "
"you take the time to learn to use them, you'll find that they take away a "
"lot of that pain."
msgstr ""

