"All these containers inside containers can cause your scene tree to become "
"quite large and hard to manage, especially if you have a lot of repeated "
"elements, such as buttons and labels. It's recommended that you break your "
"UI into pieces and save each part as a separate scene that you can instance "
"in the larger scene."
