#: 3D/spaceship.md
msgid ""
"Currently the rotations are a little to \"sharp\". The ship starts and stops "
"rotating instantly, which feels a bit too unnatural. We can solve this with "
"`lerp()`, and by adding one more configuration variable to set how "
"\"floaty\" we'd like the controls to be:"
msgstr ""
