#: 3D/rotate_interpolate.md
msgid "You want to smoothly rotate a 3D object to point in a new direction."
msgstr "3Dオブジェクトをスムーズに回転させ、新しい方向に向けさせたい場合。"

#: 3D/rotate_interpolate.md
msgid ""
"That's it! Use this handy method to rotate your 3D objects, and stop "
"thinking about angles!"
msgstr ""
"これで完了です！この便利な方法を使って3Dオブジェクトを回転させ、角度の計算に"
