#: 3D/assets/level_design.md
msgid "#### Directly placing models"
msgstr "## モデルを直接配置する"

#: 3D/assets/level_design.md
msgid ""
"Find the `wall_doorway_scaffold.glb` file in the **FileSystem** and double-"
