"in a script. The [InputMap singleton](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/"
"classes/class_inputmap.html) has methods to help you do this."
msgstr ""
"通常、入力アクションは[プロジェクト設定]から追加します（詳細は[レシピ : 入力"
