#: input/custom_actions.md
msgid ""
"Let's say you've made the platform character from [Recipe: Platform "
"character](/godot_recipes/4.x/2d/platform_character/) and you want to re-use "
"it in another project. If you saved the scene, script, and assets in a "
"single folder, you need only copy that folder to your new project. But you'd "
"still need to edit the Input Map in order for the inputs to work."
msgstr ""
"たとえば、[レシピ: プラットフォームキャラクター](/godot_recipes/4.x/ja/2d/"
"platform_character/)で作成したプラットフォームキャラクターを別のプロジェクト"
