#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"Add an {{< gd-icon AnimationTree >}}`AnimationTree` node to the scene. In "
"its _Tree Root_ property, choose \"New AnimationNodeStateMachine\"."
msgstr ""
"シーンに `{{< gd-icon AnimationTree >}}`AnimationTree` ノードを追加します。"
"［ツリールート］プロパティで「新規アニメーションノードステートマシン」を選択"
"してください。"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"Now, with \"idle\" playing, if you click \"attack2\", you'll see the two "
"attacks play in sequence."
msgstr ""
"「idle」が再生されている状態で「attack2」をクリックすると、二つの攻撃が順番に"
"再生されるようになります。"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"An {{< gd-icon AnimationTree >}}`AnimationTree` is a node that controls "
"animations created in {{< gd-icon AnimationPlayer >}}`AnimationPlayer`. To "
"let it access the existing animations, click \"Assign\" in the _Anim Player_ "
"property and select your animation node."
msgstr ""
"```{{< gd-icon AnimationTree >}}AnimationTree``` は、{{< gd-icon "
"AnimationPlayer >}}`AnimationPlayer`で作成されたアニメーションを制御するノー"
"ドです。既存のアニメーションにアクセスさせるには、_Anim Player_ プロパティ内"
"の「割り当て」ボタンをクリックし、使用するアニメーションノードを選択してくだ"
"さい。"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "Here is the full tree for all of the animations:"
msgstr "以下に、全てのアニメーションに関する完全なツリー構造を示します。"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"Right-click and choose \"Add Animation\". Choose \"idle\", and you'll see a "
"small box representing that animation. Press its \"Play\" button and you "
"should see the animation play. Do the same to add boxes for the other "
"animations."
msgstr ""
"右クリックして「アニメーションを追加」を選択します。「待機」を選択すると、そ"
"のアニメーションを表す小さなボックスが表示されます。「再生」ボタンを押すとア"
"ニメーションが実行されるはずです。他のアニメーションを追加する場合も同じ手順"
"で行ってください。"

#: ai/pet_following.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"Download the project's example code here: [https://github.com/godotrecipes/"
"ai_behavior_demos](https://github.com/godotrecipes/ai_behavior_demos)"
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのサンプルコードはこちらからダウンロードできます：[https://"
"github.com/godotrecipes/ai_behavior_demos](https://github.com/godotrecipes/"
"ai_behavior_demos)"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "### Calling states in code"
msgstr "### コード内での呼び出し状態"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "### Getting started"
msgstr "### はじめに"

#: animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/anim_tree_panel.png)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/anim_tree_panel.png)"

#: animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/animation_tree_03.png)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/animation_tree_03.png)"

#: animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"But now the animation stops on \"attack2\". On its connection, set the "
"**Advance/Mode** property to \"Auto\". This will make the tree go back to "
"\"idle\" after playing both animations. Note that the connection icon turns "
"green to show this."
msgstr ""
"しかし、現在「attack2」アニメーションが停止しています。接続時には、**進行状"
"況/モード**プロパティを「自動」に設定してください。これにより、両方のアニメー"
"ション再生後にツリーが「待機」状態に戻ります。なお、接続アイコンが緑色に変化"
"することでこの状態が表示されます。"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"Here we have examples of functions we would call if the player is hurt or "
"killed. For the other animations (running, attacking, etc.), we'll need to "
"combine them with our input and movement code. `velocity` determines whether "
"we should be showing \"run\" or \"idle\"."
msgstr ""
"以下は、プレイヤーがダメージを受けたり死亡した場合に呼び出される関数の例で"
"す。\n"
"他のアニメーション（移動、攻撃など）については、入力処理や移動制御コードと組"
"み合わせる必要があります。`velocity`変数によって、「走行」状態を表示するか"
"「待機」状態を表示するかを決定します。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/adventurer_sprite_sheet_v1.1.png)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/adventurer_sprite_sheet_v1.1.png)"

#: animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "Using the AnimationTree StateMachine"
msgstr ""

#: animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"Now we can add connections. Click the \"Connect nodes\" button and drag "
"between nodes to connect them. As an example, let's use the two attack "
"animations:"
msgstr ""
"接続を追加できるようになりました。「ノードを接続」ボタンをクリックして、ノー"
"ド間でドラッグして接続してください。例として、この2つの攻撃アニメーションを使"
"いましょう。"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"We'll also assume you've already set up the character's animations using {{< "
"gd-icon AnimationPlayer >}}`AnimationPlayer`. Using the above spritesheet, "
"we have the following animations: \"idle\", \"run\", \"attack1\", "
"\"attack2\", \"hurt\", and \"die\"."
msgstr ""
"We'll also assume you've already set up the character's animations using {{< "
"gd-icon AnimationPlayer >}}`AnimationPlayer`. Using the above spritesheet, "
"we have the following animations: \"idle\", \"run\", \"attack1\", "
"\"attack2\", \"hurt\", and \"die\"."

#: animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/animation_tree_07.gif)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/animation_tree_07.gif)"

#: animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "You can use the AnimationTreeStateMachine to handle"
msgstr "AnimationTreeStateMachineを使用して以下の処理を管理できます："

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"Use an {{< gd-icon AnimationTree >}}`AnimationTree` to create an animation "
"_state machine_. This will allow us to organize our animations and most "
"importantly, control the transitions between them."
msgstr ""
"アニメーション状態機械を作成するには `AnimationTree` (`<{ gd-icon "
"AnimationTree }>`)を使用してください。これにより、アニメーションを整理できる"
"だけでなく、最も重要な点として、それらの間の遷移を制御することが可能になりま"
"す。"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"Note that we're using `return` after traveling to the attack animations. "
"This is so that we won't instead travel to the \"run\" or \"idle\" "
"animations further down in the function."
msgstr ""
"注意：攻撃アニメーションに移動した後に`return`文を使用しています。これは、関"
"数の後半で「走り」アニメーションや「待機」アニメーションに誤って移動しないよ"
"うするためです。"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "### AnimationTree"
msgstr "### アニメーションツリー"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"A common situation: you have a large number of animations, and it's becoming "
"difficult to manage transitions between them. Your code has become full of "
"`if` statements, and every time you change something, it all breaks."
msgstr ""
"よくあるケースです：アニメーションの数が増えすぎて、シーン間の切り替え管理が"
"困難になってきていませんか？コードが大量の `if` 文で埋め尽くされ、少し変更を"
"加えるたびに全体が壊れてしまいそうになっていませんか？"

#: animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "Now the animations are played in sequence whenever they're triggered."
msgstr "アニメーションはトリガーされるたびに連続して再生されます。"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "Note the warning. Set the _Active_ property to \"On\" in the Inspector."
msgstr ""
"警告に注意してください。インスペクターで 「_アクティブ」プロパティを「オン」"
"に設定します。"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "Now let's set up the character to use these animations in a script."
msgstr ""
"それでは、これらのアニメーションをスクリプトで使用するキャラクターを設定して"
"いきましょう。"

#: animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/animation_tree_01.png)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/animation_tree_01.png)"

#: animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/animation_tree_05.gif)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/animation_tree_05.gif)"

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md animation/using_animation_sm.md
msgid ""
"Now we can begin to set up our state machine in the {{< gd-icon "
"AnimationTree >}}`AnimationTree` panel:"
msgstr "以下は、状態機械を `AnimationTree` パネルに設定し始める方法です："

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"Spritesheets are a common way for 2D animations to be distributed. In a "
"spritesheet, all of the animation frames are packed into a single image."
msgstr ""
"スプライトシートは2Dアニメーションの一般的な配布形式です。単一の画像ファイル"
"に全てのアニメーションフレームを集約した形式で、効率的なデータ管理が可能で"
"す。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid "You want to use a spritesheet containing 2D animations."
msgstr ""
"あなたは2Dアニメーションを含むスプライトシートを使用したいと考えています。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/sprite_animation_04.gif)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/sprite_animation_04.gif)"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"With the scrubber at time `0`, select the {{< gd-icon Sprite2D >}}`Sprite2D` "
"node. Set its _Animation/Frame_ to `0`, then click the key icon next to the "
"value."
msgstr ""
"スクラバーが「0」時点で、{{< gd-icon Sprite2D >}}`Sprite2D`ノードを選択しま"
"す。アニメーションのフレーム番号を「0」に設定し、値の隣にあるキーアイコンをク"
"リックします。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/sprite_animation_01.png)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/sprite_animation_01.png)"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"Select the {{< gd-icon AnimationPlayer >}}`AnimationPlayer` and click the "
"“Animation” button followed by “New\"\n"
". Name the new animation “idle”. Set the animation length to `2` and click "
"the “Loop” button so that our animation will repeat (see below)."
msgstr ""
"以下の手順に従ってアニメーションを設定します。\n"
"\n"
"1. 「AnimationPlayer」コンポーネントを選択します。\n"
"2. 「アニメーション」ボタンをクリックし、続いて「新規作成」を選択します。\n"
"3. 新しいアニメーションに「idle」という名前を付けます。\n"
"4. アニメーションの長さを `2` に設定します。\n"
"5. 「ループ」ボタンをクリックして、アニメーションが繰り返し再生されるようにし"
"ます（詳細は以下を参照）。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"Feel free to add the other animations yourself. For example, the \"jump\" "
"animation is on frames `65` through `70`."
msgstr ""
"自由に他のアニメーションを追加してください。例えば「ジャンプ」アニメーション"
"はフレーム 65～70 に設定されています。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"<!-- - [Top-down character](http://kidscancode.org/godot_recipes/2d/"
"topdown_movement/#option-1-8-way-movement) -->\n"
"- [Platform character](http://kidscancode.org/godot_recipes/2d/"
"platform_character/)\n"
"<!-- - [Controlling animation states](http://kidscancode.org/godot_recipes/"
"animation/animation_state_machine/) -->"
msgstr ""

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid "### Adding animations"
msgstr "### アニメーションの追加方法"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid "Spritesheet animation"
msgstr ""

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"If you try playing the animation, you'll see it doesn't appear to do "
"anything. That's because the last frame (12) looks the same as the first "
"(0), but we're not seeing any of the frames in-between (1-11). To fix this, "
"change the \"Update Mode\" of the track from its default value of "
"\"Discrete\" to \"Continuous\". You can find this button at the end of the "
"track on the right side."
msgstr ""
"アニメーションを再生してみると、何も変化がないように見えます。これは最後のフ"
"レーム（12）が最初のフレーム（0）と全く同じ表示になっているためで、その間のフ"
"レーム（1～11）が全く反映されていないからです。これを修正するには、トラックの"
"「更新モード」をデフォルト値の「離散」から「連続」に変更してください。このボ"
"タンはトラック右側の端に配置されています。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid "Add the following nodes to your scene:"
msgstr "以下のノードをシーンに追加してください。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"This animation technique uses a {{< gd-icon Sprite2D >}}`Sprite2D` node to "
"display the texture, and then we animate the changing frames with {{< gd-"
"icon AnimationPlayer >}}`AnimationPlayer`. This can work with any 2D node, "
"but for this demo, we'll use a {{< gd-icon CharacterBody2D >}}"
"`CharacterBody2D`."
msgstr ""
"このアニメーション手法では、`Sprite2D`ノードを使用してテクスチャを表示し、そ"
"の後`AnimationPlayer`でフレームの切り替えをアニメーション化します。これはあら"
"ゆる2Dノードで使用可能ですが、ここではデモンストレーション用に"
"`CharacterBody2D`ノードを使用しています。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"Drag the spritesheet texture into the _Texture_ property of the {{< gd-icon "
"Sprite2D >}}`Sprite2D`. You'll see the entire spritesheet displayed in the "
"viewport. To slice it up into individual frames, expand the \"Animation\" "
"section in the Inspector and set the _Hframes_ to `13` and _Vframes_ to `8`. "
"_Hframes_ and _Vframes_ are the number of horizontal and vertical frames in "
"your spritesheet."
msgstr ""
"{{< gd-icon Sprite2D >}}`Sprite2D`コンポーネントの _Texture_プロパティにスプ"
"ライトシートテクスチャをドラッグ＆ドロップしてください。ビューポート内に完全"
"なスプライトシートが表示されます。個別のフレームに分割するには、インスペク"
"ターの「Animation」セクションを拡大し、_Hframes_を `13`、_Vframes_を `8`に設"
"定します。_Hframes_と_Vframes_は、それぞれ水平方向および垂直方向のフレーム数"
"を指定するパラメータです。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/sprite_animation_03.png)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/sprite_animation_03.png)"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"Note that this will only work for spritesheets where the frames are already "
"in order. If they are not, you'll have to keyframe each _Frame_ seperately "
"along the timeline."
msgstr ""
"※この方法が有効なのは、フレームがすでに順序通りに並んでいることが前提です。そ"
"うでない場合は、タイムライン上で各_Frameを個別にキーフレーム化する必要があり"
"ます。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"For this demo, we'll be using the excellent \"Adventurer\" sprite by Elthen. "
"You can get this and lots of other great art at[https://elthen.itch.io/]"
"(https://elthen.itch.io/)."
msgstr ""
"このデモでは、Elthen氏制作の優れた「冒険者」スプライトを使用します。このア"
"セットをはじめ、多くの高品質なアート素材は以下から入手できます：[https://"
"elthen.itch.io/](https://elthen.itch.io/)。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"Try changing the _Frame_ property to see the image change. This is the "
"property we’ll be animating."
msgstr ""
"以下の手順を試してみてください：\n"
"1. 画像フレームプロパティを変更すると、画像がどのように変化するかを確認できま"
"す。これは後でアニメーション化するプロパティです。"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/sprite_animation_02.png)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/sprite_animation_02.png)"

#: animation/spritesheet_animation.md
msgid ""
"{{% notice warning %}}\n"
"Make sure the images in your spritesheet are laid out in a constant-sized "
"grid. This will enable Godot to automatically slice them. If they're packed "
"irregularly, you will not be able to use the following technique.\n"
"{{% /notice %}}"
msgstr ""
"{{% notice warning %}}\n"
"スプライトシート内の画像は均一なグリッド状に配置してください。これによりGodot"
"が自動的に画像を切り分け可能になります。不規則に配置されている場合、以下の手"
"法は使用できませんのでご注意ください。\n"
"{{% /notice %}}"

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/3.x/img/attack1.png)"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/3.x/img/attack2.png)"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid "You want to implement a melee attack, such as a sword or punch."
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/3.x/img/melee_attack_04.gif)"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid ""
"We can detect the sword hitting the target using an {{< gd-icon Area2D >}}"
"`Area2D`, but we only want that area to be active during the swing. In order "
"for this activation to be in sync with the animation, we'll use the "
"AnimationPlayer to control it."
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid "Melee attacks"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid ""
"- [Top-down character](http://kidscancode.org/godot_recipes/2d/"
"topdown_movement/#option-1-8-way-movement)\n"
"- [Controlling animation states](http://kidscancode.org/godot_recipes/"
"animation/animation_state_machine/)"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid ""
"For this example, we'll assume we have already set up a character with one "
"or more attack animations. To illustrate, we'll use these two attacks:"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/3.x/img/melee_attack_02.gif)"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/3.x/img/melee_attack_01.png)"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid ""
"Now you should be able to try it out and see the attack doing damage if the "
"target is inside the sword's hitbox."
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid ""
"Now connect this new area's `area_entered` signal (or, depending on how your "
"game is set up, `body_entered`). For the purposes of this demo, let's assume "
"that any body that can take damage has an {{< gd-icon Area2D >}}`Area2D` "
"defined and placed in a group called \"hurtbox\"."
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid ""
"Move the animation to the first frame and check the _Disabled_ property of "
"the area. Click the keyframe icon to add a track to the animation. Then "
"advance the animation to the frame where the sword is extended, and add "
"another keyframe with _Disabled_ unchecked. Finally, advance to the end of "
"the swing and keyframe _Disabled_ on once more."
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid "### Changing the hitbox size"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/3.x/img/melee_attack_05.gif)"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/3.x/img/melee_attack_03.gif)"
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid ""
"When you have more than one attack animation, the size of the affected area "
"may not be the same. In the above attack animations, the first one is an "
"upward sweeping attack that covers more area. To handle this, we also need "
"to add an animation track for the collision shape's _Extents_ property. Set "
"this and keyframe it at the start of each animation."
msgstr ""

#: animation/melee_attacks.md
msgid ""
"Add an {{< gd-icon Area2D >}}`Area2D` and {{< gd-icon CollisionShape2D >}}"
"`CollisionShape2D` to the scene. We'll use a rectangle shape for the hitbox "
"and size it so that it covers the sword during the swing frame."
msgstr ""

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/3.x/img/animation_tree_06.png)"
msgstr ""

#: animation/animation_state_machine.md
msgid "Controlling animation states"
msgstr ""

