#: g101/3d/101_3d_06.md
msgid ""
"After adding the `CSGPolygon`, you can click the _Polygon_ property to "
"adjust\n"
"its number of points. After that, you can drag the three points to whatever\n"
"location you like. To ensure everything lines up, you can type the "
