#: Math/transforms.md
msgid ""
"Knowing this, we can move the ship forward by moving it along its own **X** "
"axis and we won't have to worry about angles and trig functions. To do this "
"in Godot, we can use the `transform` property, which is available to all "
"[{{< gd-icon Node2D >}}`Node2D`]([https://link](https://docs.godotengine.org/"
"en/latest/classes/class_node2d.html)) derived nodes."
msgstr ""
"この特性を利用すれば、船を**X軸**に沿って移動させることで簡単に前進できます。"
"角度計算や三角関数を気にする必要もありません。Godotでこれを実現するには、すべ"
"ての[{{< gd-icon Node2D >}}`Node2D`]([https://link](https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/ja/latest/classes/class_node2d.html))派生ノードで利用で"
"きる`transform`プロパティを使用します。"

