"You can see the full list of the node's functions in the [API Documentation]"
"(https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_raycast2d.html). Here "
"are the some of the most useful ones:"
msgstr ""
"ノードの機能一覧は[APIドキュメント](https://docs.godotengine.org/ja/stable/"
"classes/class_raycast2d.html)で確認できます。特に便利な主要機能をいくつかご紹"
"介します。"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid ""
"*Raycasting* is a common technique in game development. \"Casting a ray\" "
"means extending a line from a point until it collides with something or "
"reaches its limit."
msgstr ""
"*レイキャスティング* はゲーム開発で広く用いられる手法です。「レイをキャストす"
"る」とは、ある点から直線を伸ばし、それが何かに衝突するか限界に達するまで移動"
"させる操作を指します。"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/kyn_raycast2d_01_4.png)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/kyn_raycast2d_01_4.png)"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid "Boolean function, lets you know if the ray is colliding with something."
msgstr "ブール型関数。レイが何らかの物体と衝突しているかどうかを判定します。"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/kyn_raycast2d_04.gif)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/kyn_raycast2d_04.gif)"

