msgid ""
"Consider a platformer enemy that walks on platforms, but you don't want it "
"to fall off the edges. Add two downward-pointing raycasts to the mob like so:"
msgstr "以下の方法でmobに下向きレイキャストを2つ追加してください。"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid ""
"Here's a player sprite with a raycast attached to the end of the gun. The "
"`target_position` is set to `(250, 0)`."
msgstr ""
"ここに、銃の先端にレイキャストが取り付けられたプレイヤースプライトがありま"
"す。`target_position`は`(250, 0)`に設定されています。"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid "* **Exclude Parent**"
msgstr "* **親ノードを除外**"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid "* **Target Position**"
msgstr "＊ 目標位置"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid "#### 1. Shooting"
msgstr "#### 1. 撮影プロセス"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
