#: physics/Godot3_KYN_rigidbody1.md
msgid ""
"> Allows you to read and **safely modify** the simulation state for the "
"object. Use this instead of `_physics_process` if you need to directly "
"change the body’s position or other physics properties."
msgstr ""

#: physics/Godot3_KYN_rigidbody1.md
msgid ""
"func _input(event):\n"
"    if event.is_action_pressed(\"click\") and not dragging:\n"
"        dragging = true\n"
"        drag_start = get_global_mouse_position()\n"
"    if event.is_action_released(\"click\") and dragging:\n"
"        dragging = false\n"
"        var drag_end = get_global_mouse_position()\n"
"        var dir = drag_start - drag_end\n"
"        apply_impulse(Vector2(), dir * 5)\n"
"{{< /highlight >}}"
msgstr ""

#: physics/Godot3_KYN_rigidbody1.md
msgid ""
"- `RigidBody2D`\n"
"    - `Sprite`\n"
"    - `CollisionShape2D`"
