"Godot offers three kinds of physics bodies, grouped under the <a "
"href=\"http://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/"
"class_physicsbody2d.html\" target=\"_blank\">`PhysicsBody2D`</a> type:"
msgstr ""

#: physics/Godot3_kinematic2d.md
msgid ""
"> **Note:** Be careful to never scale your collision shapes in the editor. "
"The `Scale` property in the Inspector should remain at `(1, 1)`. When "
"changing the size of the collision shape, you should always use the shape's "
"handles."
msgstr ""

#: physics/Godot3_kinematic2d.md
