"Then, depending whether the rectangle is wider or taller (relative to the "
"screen's aspect ratio), we find the scale and clamp it in the max/min range "
"we've defined."
msgstr ""
"次に、矩形が画面のアスペクト比に対して横長か縦長かに応じて適切なスケーリング"
"係数を求め、事前に定義した最大値/最小値の範囲内で正規化します。"

#: 2D/multi_target_camera.md
msgid ""
"Here you can see the rectangle being drawn (press \"Tab\" in the demo "
"project to enable this drawing):"
msgstr ""
"以下の画面では、長方形が描画されている様子を確認できます（デモプロジェクトで"
