#: 2D/grid_pathfinding.md
msgid ""
"`AStarGrid2D` is a specialized version of Godot's more generic `AStar2D` "
"class. Because it's specialized for using with a grid, it's quicker and "
"easier to set up because you don't have to manually add all the individual "
"grid cells and their connections."
msgstr ""
"`AStarGrid2D` はGodotの汎用クラス `AStar2D` をグリッド環境用に最適化した専用"
"バージョンです。グリッドベースで設計されているため、個々のセルや接続関係を手"
"動で追加する必要がなく、より高速かつ簡単にセットアップできます。"

#: 2D/grid_pathfinding.md
msgid "### Choosing a Heuristic"
msgstr "### ヒューリスティック選択について"

